---
import SqueakCipher from "../islands/SqueakCipher";
---

<section class="relative border-y border-cream/10 bg-ink-soft">
  <div class="glow top-10 right-10 h-80 w-80"></div>
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-6 py-28 md:py-40 lg:grid-cols-2"
  >
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="idx">03</span>安全通信,从未如此简单</p>
      <h2 class="h-section mt-4">吱到吱加密</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-dim">
        写下一条消息。捏一下。立刻安全——每个词都会被映射到同一个密文
        token,连我们自己都读不了。天才。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <SqueakCipher client:visible />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
